Package: rxvt-unicode
Version: 3.1-r1
Description: rxvt-unicode is a clone of the well known terminal emulator rxvt, modified to store text in Unicode (either UCS-2 or UCS-4) and to use locale-correct input and output. It also supports mixing multiple fonts at the same time, including Xft fonts.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://dist.schmorp.de/rxvt-unicode/rxvt-unicode-3.1.tar.bz2 	file://xim.patch;patch=1 	file://xwc.patch;patch=1
Depends: rxvt-unicode (>= 3.1), libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726), libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1), libxft2 (>= 2.1.6), libxrender1 (>= 0.8.4), libfontconfig1 (>= 2.2.95), libfreetype6 (>= 2.1.8), libz1 (>= 1.1.4), libexpat0 (>= 1.95.7), libx11-6 (>= 6.2.1), libxau0 (>= 0.1.1)
